  "description": "When you create content using the global create dropdown in Confluence, you'll now see a nudge suggesting you move it to your personal space. This helps you keep your work organized and ensures content doesn't accidentally end up in a shared space before it's ready. To get started with this change: Select Create from the global navigation.\n\tChoose a content type, such as a page, blog post, whiteboard, or database.\n\tAfter the content is created in a shared space, look for the nudge flag.\n\tSelect ",
